          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mzuri Daudi ukaghamba, “Niwangie mkohani Zadoku, mlodi Nathani, na Benaia mwana wa Jehoiada.” Nao wikacha na kukaia kimusi imbiri ya mzuri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao mzuri ukawizera, “Wadenyi wabaa wapo, mumsereshe kidombo mwana wapo Solomoni aighu ya nyumbu yapo cheni, msee nao hata Gihoni; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na aho mkohani Zadoku na mlodi Nathani wimdunge mavuda uwue mzuri wa Israeli, nao mkabe tarumbeta mghambe, ‘Mzuri Solomoni ndeduo moyo!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko aho mchajoka nyuma yake, nao uchacha na kuchiseria kifumbi chapo cha nguma; angu uo nuo uchaakaia mzuri wulalo ghwapo, na nuo nammbika ukaie mzuri aighu ya Israeli na Juda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
