            "sid": "1KI 1:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adonija na awo wandu wose werekwanyeghe wikija karamu wikasikira ingelo werekoghe wikimeria kuja. Joabu uendasikira iro chwaka ra tarumbeta ukaghamba, “Iro ndoghoi riko mzinyi ni ra indoki?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hata iji orekoghe ukideda, Jonathani mwana wa mkohani Abiathari ukacha. Adonija ukamzera, “Karibu oho mundu mucha, namanya kwaadiredia malagho mecha.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jonathani ukamtumbulia Adonija, “Hata! Bwana odu Mzuri Daudi wam'bonya Solomoni ukaie mzuri; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nao wamduma mkohani Zadoku, na mlodi Nathani, na Benaia mwana wa Jehoiada, na walindiri wa mzuri wimjose Solomoni aighu ya nyumbu ya mzuri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mkohani Zadoku na mlodi Nathani wameria kumdunga mavuda aja Gihoni, upate kukaia mzuri; niko wajoka aho wikiboilwa na muzi ghose kunyavurika. Iro niro chwaka mwarisikira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomoni wameria kuchiseria icho kifumbi cha nguma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na aighu ya agho, wabaa wa mzuri wacha kwa bwana odu Mzuri Daudi wikimneka pongezi na kughamba, ‘Mlungu wako ndejibonye irina ja Solomoni jikaie ibaa kuchumba jako, uchibonye kifumbi chake cha nguma chikaie kibaa kuchumba chako.’ Na Mzuri ukadikia ukikughoghomesha uo moni uko aighu wulinyi kwake ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na kutasa ukighamba, ‘Bwana, uo Mlungu wa Israeli ndekaso, uo wam'bonya umu wa kivalwa chapo kusea kidombo aighu ya kifumbi chapo cha nguma idime ngiwona.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.48"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko waghenyi wose wa Adonija wikaobua, wikawuka na kughenda kula mundu chia yake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adonija ukikaia na wowa m'baa kwa kumuobua Solomoni, ukawuka na kughenda cha Hemenyi. Ukawadia mbembe ra madhabahu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1.50",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mbembe ra madhabahu:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "mndungi ukawada mbembe ra madhabahu ukoghe ubwagho ndechaabwaghwa.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao Mzuri Solomoni ukaghorelwa kukaia Adonija wamuobua ukakimbia cha madhabahunyi na kuriwadia mbembe raro ukighamba, “Mpaka Mzuri Solomoni unibonyere ighemi kukaia ndechaanibwagha; aho niko nichaafuma.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.1.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.1.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 1:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mzuri Solomoni ukaghamba, “Kawona wakuwonyera moni kukaia mundu ufwane, hata luwiriro lwake lwa iridia ndeluchaainjwa; ela wuwiwi ghukawoneka kwake, uchabwaghwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
